        "text": "Merkle Tree — Block 170 (2 TXIDs)\n\nExpected Merkle root: 7dac2c5666815c17a3b36427de37bb9d2e2c5ccec3f8633eb91a4205cb4c10ff\n\nStep by step:\n  1. TXID₀ and TXID₁ are in display format (big-endian)\n  2. reverse_txid_bytes converts each to internal byte order (little-endian)\n  3. concat_all joins them: LE(TXID₀) + LE(TXID₁)\n  4. double_sha256_hex hashes the concatenation\n  5. reverse_txid_bytes flips the result back to display format → Merkle Root",
